<title>CHINA: Trading in Hwa Kay Thai shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Hwa Kay Thai shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Hwa Kay Thai Holdings Ltd was suspended at midday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>The company's shares gained HK$0.09 or 12.5 percent to HK$0.81 each prior to the trading suspension. Volume was 20.67 million shares worth HK$16.77 million.</p>
<p>Hwa Kay Thai distributes and markets Puma brand products and operates restaurants.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
